1
00:00:00,580 --> 00:00:02,600
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) She has a dog.

2
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:04,940
It is white.

3
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:07,620
It has short legs.

4
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:10,900
It has pointy ears.

5
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:14,380
It runs very fast.

6
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:17,260
She plays with the dog.

7
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:21,160
She throws a toy across the room.

8
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:24,720
She tells the dog to get it.

9
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:27,340
The dog runs.

10
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:29,340
She watches it.

11
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:32,280
The dog runs back to her.

12
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:36,240
The toy is in the dog's mouth.
